---
description: Rules for React and TypeScript frontend
globs: ["apps/desktop/frontend/src/**/*.{ts,tsx}"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use TypeScript strict mode.
- Keep networking, filesystem writes, and download orchestration in Go.
- Use typed Wails bindings and events when calling Go.
- Keep components small and feature-oriented.
- Handle loading, empty, error, and reconnect states.
- Do not simulate progress or invent speed/ETA.
- Make core actions keyboard accessible.
- Do not expose arbitrary filesystem or shell capabilities.
